course: dictionary
lesson: 15759
title: A word with a famous story
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words come from a story, and knowing the story helps you understand them. Trojan is one of these. «The Trojans defended their walls for ten years.» Trojans are people from Troy, the ancient city, so the story tells you where the word comes from.
explain: Check the clues. «The Greeks left a huge wooden horse outside the city gates.» Soldiers were hiding inside it. «That night the soldiers crept out and opened the gates.» This is the Trojan Horse, a story about a trick that gets an enemy inside. Try your meaning in the sentence: a Trojan Horse is a sneaky trick, not a real horse.
explain: Trojan has a second meaning in computing. «Dad said, "Don't open that free game, it might be a trojan."» A computer trojan is a harmful program that pretends to be something useful. Like the wooden horse, it looks like a gift but hides danger.
explain: Look at the capital letter. Trojan with a capital T usually means from Troy or about Troy. A lowercase trojan on a computer means a harmful program. The words around it will tell you which meaning fits.
fact: Trojan means from Troy, the ancient city in what is now Turkey; a Trojan is a person from Troy.
fact: The Trojan Horse is the story of a huge wooden horse the Greeks left outside Troy, with soldiers hiding inside.
fact: At night the hidden soldiers came out and took the city.
fact: On a computer, a trojan is a harmful program that pretends to be something useful, like a game or a free app.
fact: «To work like a Trojan» means to work very hard (UK, old-fashioned).
exercise: «The Trojans defended their walls for ten years.» What does Trojans mean here? | Builders of boats | Greek sailors | *People from Troy | Horses kept in a stable
exercise: «Dad said, "Don't open that free game, it might be a trojan."» What is a trojan on a computer? | A free game that always works | A fast new computer | *A harmful program that pretends to be something useful | A file that makes the screen bigger
exercise: «They worked like Trojans to finish the painting before dinner.» What does worked like Trojans mean? | Ate their dinner quickly | Went to sleep early | Painted with a brush | *Worked very hard
test: The story of the Trojan Horse is about what? | *A wooden horse with soldiers hiding inside, used as a trick | A horse race held in Troy | A famous horse that won a prize
test: Ella's new app asks to be installed, but it is a trojan. What does this mean? | A free gift from a friend | It makes your computer faster | *It is a harmful program hiding behind something useful | A new computer game
exam: Which sentence uses Trojan to mean from Troy? | «Mum said the file was a trojan and to delete it.» | *«The Trojan War was fought near the city of Troy.» | «He warned us about a trojan hidden in the free app.»
